(7595565, 1225515, 50695, '<td valign="top">At 5 to 6 on a Monday evening<br/>you heard the news, and started grieving.<br/>Mum wouldn''t want a lot of flowers<br/>or a pastor talking for an hour.<br/>When you''ve settled on the casket and the cost,<br/>you notice somehow your childhood''s lost.<br/>Your picture on the wall has faded.<br/>You''re a domino, and time has played it.</td>', 'At 5 to 6 on a Monday eveningyou heard the news, and started grieving.Mum wouldn''t want a lot of flowersor a pastor talking for an hour.When you''ve settled on the casket and the cost,you notice somehow your childhood''s lost.Your picture on the wall has faded.You''re a domino, and time has played it.', '2018-09-09 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595567, 1225609, 50695, '<td valign="top">the present moment<br/>flashes into view<br/>and disappears again <br/>into forever</td>', 'the present momentflashes into viewand disappears again into forever', '2018-09-09 19:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
