(7595574, 1225573, 50695, '<td valign="top">Time is a passageway.<br/>The past is painted on the walls.<br/>The present walks through it,<br/>briefly acknowledging<br/>the past that kneels to him.</td>', 'Time is a passageway.The past is painted on the walls.The present walks through it,briefly acknowledgingthe past that kneels to him.', '2018-09-09 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
